{
  "name": "Cross-post an image to Instagram, Pinterest, Facebook, and Threads",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Cross-post an image to Instagram, Pinterest, Facebook, and Threads\n\n### How it works\n\n1. Runs when you click Execute Workflow.\n2. Sets the caption and imageUrl used to build the post.\n3. Publishes posts to Instagram, Pinterest, Facebook, and Threads via the SocialRobot API.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- [ ] Install the SocialRobot community node and connect your SocialRobot API credential (API key: socialrobot.io, Scheduler -> API Keys).\n- [ ] In the Set post image node, set the caption and imageUrl to your own content.\n- [ ] Select your connected SocialRobot account in each Publish node.\n- [ ] Set your Pinterest board ID in the Publish to Pinterest node.\n\n### Customization\n\nChange the caption and imageUrl in the Set post image node to publish different content. Run it any time to post, or connect a Schedule Trigger to automate it.",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 590
      },
